Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 10:10:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [patch 22] test: remove redundant Equatable inheritance from
 range fixture

Comparable already inherits Equatable. Avoid inheriting the local-mode default comparison members through both paths while preserving the range type constraints and test behavior.

Validation: all 26 original compiler O2 cases and the existing diamond-default rejection control pass with -O2. All 28 cjc invocations were audited to contain -O2.
Signed-off-by: Mr_Kang_Yi <kangyi9@h-partners.com>
---
 .../TypesAndVariables/immutable/immutable_range_02.cj         | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/testsuites/HLT/compiler/cjnative/TypesAndVariables/immutable/immutable_range_02.cj b/testsuites/HLT/compiler/cjnative/TypesAndVariables/immutable/immutable_range_02.cj
index 27cf1a5e3d6e12ede80bd5b1656d649a6c085977..853a06b9ee6e4e936fef28297ed443594ef4db44 100644
